@startuml F7.9-D01-saude-sistema
title F7.9-D01 — Carregar KPIs de saúde
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "HealthController" as Ctrl
participant "SystemHealthUseCase" as UC
participant "ActuatorService" as Act

Admin -> WebApp: /admin/sistema/saude
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /admin/sistema/saude
Jwt -> Ctrl: system.admin ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Act: 4 metrics paralelo
note right of Act
  Actuator interno
  (não exposto ao browser)
end note
Act --> UC: valores
UC --> WebApp: 200 KPIs + sla
WebApp --> Admin: KpiCards

@enduml
